2026-11-07T05:45:12.0343653Z [0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
2026-11-07T05:45:12.0355419Z 
2026-11-07T05:45:12.0356021Z I will:
2026-11-07T05:45:12.0356318Z 
2026-11-07T05:45:12.0356580Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
2026-11-07T05:45:12.0357134Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
2026-11-07T05:45:12.0357675Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
2026-11-07T05:45:12.0358183Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
2026-11-07T05:45:12.0358559Z  - install Nix in /nix
2026-11-07T05:45:12.0358925Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
2026-11-07T05:45:12.0359449Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
2026-11-07T05:45:12.0359938Z    /root
2026-11-07T05:45:12.0360763Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
2026-11-07T05:45:12.0361402Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-11-07T05:45:12.0371940Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
2026-11-07T05:45:12.0372547Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
2026-11-07T05:45:12.0372763Z 
2026-11-07T05:45:12.0374220Z [32m[4;32mReady to continue?
2026-11-07T05:45:12.0374886Z [0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
